# ── Output (Monitor) Configuration ────────────────
# Use `swaymsg -t get_outputs` to list available outputs

# Default: auto-detect
# Wallpaper is handled by mpvpaper (see autostart)
# output * bg ~/.config/sway/wallpapers/default.png fill

# Examples for dual monitor (uncomment and adjust):
# Primary: 144Hz gaming/main display
# output DP-1 resolution 2560x1440@144Hz position 0 0

# Secondary: to the right of primary
# output HDMI-A-1 resolution 1920x1080@60Hz position 2560 0

# Laptop display
# output eDP-1 resolution 1920x1080@144Hz position 0 0

# Mirror mode
# output HDMI-A-1 resolution 1920x1080 position 0 0
